cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Ampullaceana balthica 16S rRNA Gut Microbiome Pipeline"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Veloster122/Ampullaceana-balthica"
authors:
  - family-names: "Moura"
    given-names: "Renato Yuji Ishikawa de"
    email: "renatinho.ishikawa@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "Centro de Ecologia, Evolução e Alterações Ambientais (cE3c), Faculdade de Ciências da Universidade de Lisboa / Escola Superior de Tecnologia do Barreiro (ESTBarreiro - IPS)"
keywords:
  - "microbiome"
  - "16S rRNA"
  - "Ampullaceana balthica"
  - "Radix balthica"
  - "QIIME 2"
  - "Snakemake"
  - "GLMM"
  - "metacoder"
  - "bioinformatics"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible end-to-end bioinformatics and statistical pipeline for 16S rRNA
  amplicon sequencing data of the gut microbiome of Ampullaceana balthica.
  Built with Snakemake and QIIME 2, integrating quality control (fastp),
  denoising (DADA2), taxonomic classification (SILVA 138.2), phylogenetic
  diversity, advanced Generalized Linear Mixed Models (glmmTMB), and
  differential abundance visualizations via metacoder Heat Trees.
